├─►RQ2:Classification—RandomForest (500trees),XGBoost,SVM(RBF)
│ stratified80/20split・10-foldCV・SpatialStripSplitting
│ metrics:Accuracy,Precision,Recall,F1,MCC・SHAPinterpretation
│ target:>85% held-outaccuracy, McNemar testvs.expertmethods
│
├─►RQ3:Patterndiscovery—Apriori association rules
│ (support≥0.05,confidence≥0.70,lift > 2.0),
│ co-occurrencenetworkanalysis,Pearson/Spearmangradecorrelations
│
└─►RQ4:Spatio-temporalanalysis—Moran'sI&LISAhotspots,
KernelDensityEstimationheatmaps,DBSCANbeltdelineation,
metallogenicage-frequencyanalysisvs.geodynamicevents
